OL,3,AMistakes to avoid when buying
OL,4,AGlastonbury tickets
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlastonbury Festival has confirmed that
OL,7,Ftickets for the 2027 event will go on
OL,8,Fsale later this week.
OL,10,FAfter taking a year off in 2026,
OL,11,Fthousands of festival-goers are
OL,12,Fpreparing to secure a place at next
OL,13,Fyear's five-day event.
OL,15,FCoach and ticket packages are due to go
OL,16,Fon sale at 18:00 BST on Thursday and
OL,17,Fgeneral admission tickets a few days
OL,18,Flater at 09:00 on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
